@startuml deploy-flow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #1F2937
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

left to right direction

actor "Developer / Maintainer" as dev
rectangle "GitHub Repository" as repo
rectangle "GitHub Actions" as gha
rectangle "Terraform" as tf
rectangle "S3 State Backend" as s3
rectangle "AWS" as aws
rectangle "VPC / EKS / RDS / ECR / IAM" as infra
rectangle "Docker Build" as docker
rectangle "Amazon ECR" as ecr
rectangle "Kubernetes Cluster" as eks
rectangle "Namespace oficina" as ns
rectangle "ConfigMap + Secret" as k8sconf
rectangle "Deployment oficina-api" as deploy
rectangle "Service LoadBalancer" as svc
rectangle "Swagger / API" as api

dev --> repo : push / merge / dispatch
repo --> gha : trigger workflow

gha --> tf : terraform init / plan / apply

tf --> s3 : read/write state
s3 --> tf : terraform.tfstate remote

tf --> infra : provisiona infraestrutura
infra --> aws : VPC, EKS, RDS, ECR, IAM

gha --> docker : mvn test + docker build

docker --> ecr : push image versionada

gha --> eks : aws eks update-kubeconfig

gha --> ns : create namespace

gha --> k8sconf : create/update secret

gha --> deploy : kubectl apply -k k8s

deploy --> eks : deployment oficina-api

deploy --> svc : expõe API via LoadBalancer
svc --> api : http://host/swagger-ui.html

api --> aws : acesso ao banco no RDS via JDBC
aws --> infra : RDS PostgreSQL

note right of gha
  Fluxo único da pipeline:
  1) provisiona infra
a 2) testa app
  3) constrói imagem
  4) publica no ECR
  5) prepara cluster
  6) aplica K8s
  7) atualiza deployment
  8) expõe serviço
end note
@enduml
